  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0cm;mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;\r\ntext-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0cm;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The proposed first floor side to rear and gable end extension by\r\nreason of the lack of set back from the site boundary, the first floor\r\nextensions lack of set in from the first floor side extension in conjunction\r\nwith its prominent corner siting and the excessive width of the roof would\r\nresult in a dominant, bulky and incongruous form of development and an\r\nuncharacteristic loss of openness to the spatial setting of the locality to the\r\ndetriment of the character and appearance of the existing dwellinghouse, the street\r\nscene and the established and prevailing pattern of development in the area,\r\ncontrary to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;the high quality\r\ndesign aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), policy D3.D(1) and D (11) of The London Plan (2021), Policy\r\nGR1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) and the adopted Supplementary Planning\r\nDocument Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
